{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>You shall possess their land.</b> That you come and dispossess them — that you opened first. And thus it says: ״גן נעול אחותי כלה״ etc." "<b>And I give it to you.</b> For it is nothing but the portion of Shem, and you are the sons of Shem, and they are only the sons of Ham — so what is their business in it? Only that they should be keepers of the place until you arrive." "<b>I am HaShem your Elohim.</b> And you do not need another."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:13:51.896216517Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}